WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:02.160
Hey guys,
Today I want to share&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:08.880
with you 10 things that I do every day to have&nbsp;
a purpose driven, fulfilled and peaceful life.&nbsp;

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:14.400
A victorious life.
And let me kick it off by giving you this quote&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.360
that I believe every man should know and live by.
CS Lewis said:

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:32.120
This is the way I live my life.
I do the right thing no matter what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:39.440
other people say or even when no one is looking.
I do the right thing and then I can be happy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:44.000
content with whatever happens.
Because I know I've done the right thing.&nbsp;

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.960
I've done my best.
And the rest is up to God.

